▶ UEP IoT/M2M service
  ✔ runs provider -> machine -> request -> contract -> HOLD -> telemetry -> verification -> settlement (40.522298ms)
  ✔ is idempotent for repeated service requests (15.258127ms)
  ✔ rejects unregistered providers and machines (9.726696ms)
  ✔ rejects listing/provider or machine/provider mismatches (12.649012ms)
  ✔ requires HOLD before simulated execution and verification before settlement (19.804786ms)
  ✔ rejects telemetry tampering, wrong machine and replayed sequence (15.735456ms)
  ✔ rejects telemetry from another request/contract and stale telemetry (25.05223ms)
  ✔ settlement is replay-safe and charges the marketplace fee once (19.671263ms)
